<title>USA: USAir lowers domestic fares.</title>
<headline>USAir lowers domestic fares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>USAir Group Inc said Wednesday it again lowered domestic fares, following a similar cut Monday.</p>
<p>USAir said it will offer transcontinental fares as low as $218 roundtrip, with &quot;red eye&quot; fares an additional $60 to $80 lower.  </p>
<p>Trans World Airlines also said Wednesday it lowered domestic fares, matching fare reductions initiated by America West Airlines Inc.</p>
<p>TWA said tickets must be purchased by October 25, with travel completed by February 13.</p>
<p>Fare cuts announced Wednesday follow fare reductions initiated on Monday by Continental Airlines Inc.</p>
</text>
